# A passwd file an operator mounted and has not filled in yet.
#
# This pins "open unless configured": comments only means no usable entry, which means
# no password login, which means LabView enforces nothing and says so once in the log.
# A file like this must never produce a login screen nobody can get past.
#
# Add a line with:
#   docker exec -it labview node dist/hashpw.js alice
